      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「天の国は、美しい緑と朗らかな人々の住まう楽園。\r\n姫君が守る、白亜の楽園。\r\nしかし、ある日、天の国は空の災禍で地上に落ちた」",
        "official_en": "“A paradise lush with greenery, where people lived in harmony.\r\nLife thrived in jollity under the princess’s sovereignty.\r\n’Til that fateful day when the skies brought tragedy, and Welkinlond fell, lost to calamity.",
        "real_en": "\"Welkinlond was a paradise of beautiful greenery and cheerful people, a white paradise watched over by a princess. But one day, a calamity in the sky sent Welkinlond falling to earth.\""
      },
      "review": {
